summary:
  The pending seek is made also when the engine has just given the list up.

history:
  The engine's check may end in the broadcast: by then the player holds
  the station's address, and a seek made after it would be a seek in live
  radio.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
                      if (timeshift.sourceLoaded(playMusic.seekable, playMusic.duration)) playMusic.position = seekMs;

replace:
                      timeshift.sourceLoaded(playMusic.seekable, playMusic.duration); playMusic.position = seekMs;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_player_is_asked_about_a_list_before_it_is_sought.
  Line-neutral.
